ng, a technique used to obtain low-dimensional embeddings of words based on their similarity annotations.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'GloVe Loss Function': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The loss function used by GloVe to learn word embeddings. It is defined as:  ∑_(i,j)  f(X_(ij)) * (w_i^T w_j + b_i + b_j - log(X_(ij)))^2, where X_(ij) is the co-occurrence count of words i and j, f is a weighting function, w_i and w_j are the word embeddings, and b_i and b_j are bias terms.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'ViCo Loss Function': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The loss function used by ViCo to learn word embeddings. It is defined as: ∑_(i,j,t)  f(X_(ij)^t) * (w_i^T φ_t(w_j) + b_i^t + b_j - log(X_(ij)^t))^2, where X_(ij)^t is the co-occurrence count of words i and j for co-occurrence type t, f is a weighting function, w_i is the word embedding, φ_t is a type-specific transformation function, and b_i^t and b_j are bias terms.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'Equation (1)': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The equation representing the GloVe objective function, which is used to learn word embeddings.'], 'source_chunk_index': [0]}, 'ViCo embeddings': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['Visual Co-occurrence embeddings, a method for learning word embeddings.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'Visual Genome': {'type': ['dataset', 'dataset'], 'description': ['A dataset used for estimating visual co-occurrence counts and training ViCo.', 'A dataset used for visual co-occurrence counts and training.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 1]}, 'Adagrad': {'type': ['method', 'method'], 'description': ['An optimization algorithm reported to work best for GloVe.', 'An optimization algorithm used in the context of GloVe.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1, 1]}, 'Object-Hypernym (oh) counts': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Counts computed using ImageNet synsets and their ancestors in WordNet.'], 'source_chunk_index': [1]}, 'CIFAR-100 dataset': {'type': ['dataset', 'datase